                "toolDescription": "You have access to a vector database named 'Juvelle-Knowledge'. This database is the source of truth for the brand. It documents that Juvelle is a Kerala-exclusive brand selling affordable premium churidar tops. It explicitly states that there is no Cash on Delivery (COD) and no website currently. Always check this database before answering questions about shipping times, courier partners (Delhivery), or fabric quality to ensure you do not hallucinate incorrect policies.",
